# GPS traces captured on a real device for calibrating the movement filter.
# They are raw position logs: a trace recorded at home carries the home address,
# and committing one writes it into the history permanently. Keep them local.
# Anonymised fixtures for tests belong in a test resources folder, not here.
traces/
